{"ref":"BDB, מִבְחָר","hw":"מִבְחָר","html":"† I. <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְחָר</span>]</big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] (<strong>f.</strong> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.5\">Ez 24:5</a>) <strong>choicest, best</strong>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְחַר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.11\">Dt 12:11</a> + 10 times; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִבְחָרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:15\" href=\"/Daniel.11.15\">Dn 11:15</a>; vows <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:11\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.11\">Dt 12:11</a>; valleys <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 22:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.22.7\">Is 22:7</a>; fir trees <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 37:24\" href=\"/Isaiah.37.24\">Is 37:24</a>; cedars <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 22:7\" href=\"/Jeremiah.22.7\">Je 22:7</a>; bones <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:4\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.4\">Ez 24:4</a>; sepulchres <a data-ref=\"Genesis 23:6\" href=\"/Genesis.23.6\">Gn 23:6</a> (P); of the flock <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 24:5\" href=\"/Ezekiel.24.5\">Ez 24:5</a>; of the Assyrians <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:7\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.7\">Ez 23:7</a>; captains <a data-ref=\"Exodus 15:4\" href=\"/Exodus.15.4\">Ex 15:4</a> (E poet.); young men <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 48:15\" href=\"/Jeremiah.48.15\">Je 48:15</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מבחר וטוב לבנון</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 31:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.31.16\">Ez 31:16</a> (del. <span dir=\"rtl\">וטוב</span> 𝔊 Co); <span dir=\"rtl\">עַם מִבְחָרָיו</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:15\" href=\"/Daniel.11.15\">Dn 11:15</a> = <em>his choice troops</em>.","next":"BDB, מִבְחוֹר","prev":"BDB, יִבְחָר"}